	"transcription": [
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:00:00,000",
				"to": "00:00:02,720"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 0,
				"to": 2720
			},
			"text": " Stomping rain from falling on something with an umbrella is boring."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:00:02,720",
				"to": "00:00:06,240"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 2720,
				"to": 6240
			},
			"text": " What if you tried to stop rain with a laser that targeted and vaporized each incoming"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:00:06,240",
				"to": "00:00:08,720"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 6240,
				"to": 8720
			},
			"text": " droplet before it could come within 10 feet of the ground?"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:00:08,720",
				"to": "00:00:10,880"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 8720,
				"to": 10880
			},
			"text": " Now, it's not a very practical idea."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:00:10,880",
				"to": "00:00:13,200"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 10880,
				"to": 13200
			},
			"text": " First, let's look at how much energy the laser would need."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:00:13,200",
				"to": "00:00:17,360"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 13200,
				"to": 17360
			},
			"text": " Vaporizing a liter of water takes about 2.6 megajoules of energy, and a big rainstorm"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:00:17,360",
				"to": "00:00:19,680"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 17360,
				"to": 19680
			},
			"text": " might drop half an inch of rain per hour."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:00:19,680",
				"to": "00:00:22,960"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 19680,
				"to": 22960
			},
			"text": " Oddly enough, you can just multiply these two numbers together in a smart calculator"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:00:22,960",
				"to": "00:00:26,640"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 22960,
				"to": 26640
			},
			"text": " like Wolfram Alpha or Google, and the units work out to give you an answer in terms of"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:00:26,640",
				"to": "00:00:29,360"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 26640,
				"to": 29360
			},
			"text": " power per surface area, which is exactly what we're looking for."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:00:29,360",
				"to": "00:00:33,280"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 29360,
				"to": 33280
			},
			"text": " The calculator says that we need 9 kilowatts of power per square meter we want to protect"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:00:33,280",
				"to": "00:00:34,400"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 33280,
				"to": 34400
			},
			"text": " with our laser."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:00:34,400",
				"to": "00:00:37,840"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 34400,
				"to": 37840
			},
			"text": " 9 kilowatts per square meter is nearly 10 times the amount of power Earth's surface"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:00:37,840",
				"to": "00:00:39,120"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 37840,
				"to": 39120
			},
			"text": " receives from the sun."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:00:39,120",
				"to": "00:00:42,960"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 39120,
				"to": 42960
			},
			"text": " And while that sounds like a lot of energy, we need to remember that water's capacity"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:00:42,960",
				"to": "00:00:44,560"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 42960,
				"to": 44560
			},
			"text": " to absorb energy is incredible."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:00:44,560",
				"to": "00:00:47,600"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 44560,
				"to": 47600
			},
			"text": " Heating water up to boiling only takes about 10% of the energy."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:00:47,600",
				"to": "00:00:50,560"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 47600,
				"to": 50560
			},
			"text": " Getting it from liquid to gas takes the other 90%."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:00:50,560",
				"to": "00:00:53,840"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 50560,
				"to": 53840
			},
			"text": " Ultimately, we're talking about filling the air with tons of hot steam,"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:00:53,840",
				"to": "00:00:57,040"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 53840,
				"to": 57040
			},
			"text": " so basically we'd be building a human-sized autoclave."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:00:57,040",
				"to": "00:00:58,320"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 57040,
				"to": 58320
			},
			"text": " But it gets worse."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:00:58,320",
				"to": "00:01:02,400"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 58320,
				"to": 62400
			},
			"text": " You can also see that the laser mostly splatters the droplet rather than vaporizing it."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:01:02,400",
				"to": "00:01:06,240"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 62400,
				"to": 66240
			},
			"text": " The implication is that completely vaporizing a droplet would probably take even more than"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:01:06,240",
				"to": "00:01:09,200"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 66240,
				"to": 69200
			},
			"text": " the already unreasonable amount of power we were considering."
		}
	]
